        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Austin Nichols, Richard Loncraine, Paul Bettany, Kirsten Dunst, Izabella Miko, Beth Grant\n- Films: The Day After Tomorrow, Wimbledon, The House of Usher\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Wimbledon was released as a British romantic comedy film directed by Richard Loncraine.\n- In 2004, Wimbledon starred Paul Bettany as a washed-up tennis professional and Kirsten Dunst as an up-and-coming tennis star.\n- Austin Nichols is also known for his roles in the films The Day After Tomorrow and Wimbledon.\n- The House of Usher starred Austin Nichols, Izabella Miko, and Beth Grant.",
